7408, `-10%` at `n=6` on 248320x5120), which is what the legacy-family `NUM_COLS >= 6` gate is for. `q5_K` at `n=1`, its only MMVQ width, is a wash. Every number here is from a `GGML_VK_FORCE_MMVQ=1` arm; a **default-routing re-pair is owed**. |
